{"guid":"grp-203-111","timestamp_unix_ms":1765122073112,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+19292296203","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I cannot see why Mrs.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-203-112","timestamp_unix_ms":1766072092792,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"If it were merely a fine house richly furnished,\" said she, \"I should not care about it myself; but the grounds are delightful.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-203-113","timestamp_unix_ms":1767018349673,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+13123342349","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"My sisters may write to _me_.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-203-114","timestamp_unix_ms":1767962447659,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+19293298440","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" \"I am afraid you do not like your pen.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-203-115","timestamp_unix_ms":1768908704412,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+19292296203","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"My dear Eliza, he must be in love with you, or he would never have called on us in this familiar way.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-203-116","timestamp_unix_ms":1769849817357,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+13125644879","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Darcy, \"There is a very fine old saying, which everybody here is of course familiar with--'Keep your breath to cool your porridge,'--and I shall keep mine to swell my song.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-203-117","timestamp_unix_ms":1770792554687,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+13123342349","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"But it is fortunate,\" thought she, \"that I have something to wish for. I was so afraid, you know, that something would happen to put it off, and then I should have gone quite distracted.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-203-118","timestamp_unix_ms":1771732514374,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+19293298440","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"It is very unlucky; but as I have actually paid the visit, we cannot escape the acquaintance now. Elizabeth dared not lift up her eyes.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-203-119","timestamp_unix_ms":1772672282169,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"While these newly-born notions were passing in their heads, the perturbation of Elizabeth's feelings was every moment increasing.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-203-120","timestamp_unix_ms":1773611862613,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+13125644879","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"There is not one of his tenants or servants but what will give him a good name.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-203-121","timestamp_unix_ms":1774546108039,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+13123342349","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"But their father, though very laconic in his expressions of pleasure, was really glad to see them; he had felt their importance in the family circle.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"grp-203-122","timestamp_unix_ms":1775484555581,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+19293298440","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"But how little of permanent happiness could belong to a couple who were only brought together because their passions were stronger than their virtue, she could easily conjecture.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
